  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\" /></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><strong>CREATE 6.0 更新！</strong></span></p>\n\n  \n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">這個模組包匯集了最好的 Create 模組，為你在 Minecraft 中提供獨特的工程與自動化體驗。探索建造複雜機器和自動化系統的全新方式，徹底改變你的世界。憑藉創新工具，你可以無限制地設計和實驗。準備好利用最優質的 Create 模組，將你的創造力提升到全新境界。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\" /></span></p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">這個模組包匯集了最好的 Create 模組，讓你沉浸在一個充滿無限可能的世界中，在這裡工程、自動化和創意不受限制。建造令人驚嘆的機器、自動化複雜的任務，並用創新工具改造你的世界。從先進的交通系統到複雜的自動化工廠，這個模組包提供了一切所需，讓你在獨特且動態的環境中設計和實驗。非常適合多人遊戲，你可以與朋友合作，共同打造驚人的工程專案。釋放你的創造力，用最優質的 Create 模組將你的世界變成工程奇蹟！</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\" /></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong>立即獲取你的專屬 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">，與朋友一起享受無盡的冒險！憑藉頂級性能和穩定在線時間，我們的伺服器保證為每個人提供順暢且有趣的遊戲體驗。使用代碼 <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>即可享有</span><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"> 25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1178965/description_f03a1a34-ef08-4d7a-8a27-b1d877043ea9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1178965/description_f9433999-ddde-439b-b599-e3c99af5edbb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1178965/description_0a05e792-3daa-4f08-8c49-4d63c5c42b62.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"441\" /></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\" /></a></p>",
